# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vaultly Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Google OAuth 2.0 Client ID
# Get yours at https://console.cloud.google.com/
#   1. Create / select a project
#   2. APIs & Services → Credentials → Create Credentials → OAuth 2.0 Client ID
#   3. Application type: Web application
#   4. Authorised JavaScript origins: http://localhost:3000 (and your prod domain)
#   5. Authorised redirect URIs: not required for the implicit flow used here
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=YOUR_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID_HERE
